You are supporting a process mining research prototype.
Use only the synthetic scenario information provided below.
Do not invent company-specific system names, product names, confidential logs, internal metrics, or real organizational details.
Return valid JSON only. Do not wrap it in Markdown.

Scenario ID: S08
Scenario title: Meeting Room Reservation
Initial workflow description:
A meeting room is reserved for a team meeting. The organizer checks availability and shares the room information with participants.

Clarification questions:
[
  {
    "id": "Q1",
    "question": "What event or action triggers the start of the meeting room reservation process — for example, does someone submit a request form, send a meeting invite, or initiate it through a specific system?"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q2",
    "question": "What tool or method does the organizer use to check room availability, and does it provide real-time data or require manual verification?"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q3",
    "question": "Once a room is selected, is the reservation automatically confirmed, or does it require approval from a room administrator or facilities manager before it is finalized?"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q4",
    "question": "Through which channel or system does the organizer notify participants of the reserved room details — for instance, a calendar invitation update, an email, or a team messaging tool?"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q5",
    "question": "If the requested room is not available for the desired time slot, what steps does the organizer follow — is there a defined process for selecting an alternative room or escalating the request?"
  },
  {
    "id": "Q6",
    "question": "Is there a defined process for cancelling or changing a confirmed room reservation, and if so, who is responsible for initiating it and notifying affected participants?"
  }
]
Reference workflow for oracle use:
{
  "goal": "Reserve an appropriate meeting room and notify participants with room details.",
  "actors": [
    "meeting organizer",
    "meeting participants",
    "facility system"
  ],
  "systems": [
    "calendar system",
    "room reservation system",
    "email or collaboration tool"
  ],
  "inputs": [
    "meeting date and time",
    "participant count",
    "location preference",
    "equipment needs"
  ],
  "outputs": [
    "room reservation",
    "calendar invitation",
    "participant notification"
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "id": "A1",
      "name": "Collect meeting time and participant count",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    },
    {
      "id": "A2",
      "name": "Check room availability",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    },
    {
      "id": "A3",
      "name": "Select room matching capacity and equipment needs",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    },
    {
      "id": "A4",
      "name": "Reserve selected room",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    },
    {
      "id": "A5",
      "name": "Create or update calendar invitation",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    },
    {
      "id": "A6",
      "name": "Notify participants of room information",
      "actor": "meeting organizer"
    }
  ],
  "decisions": [
    {
      "id": "D1",
      "condition": "Is a suitable room available?",
      "branches": [
        "available",
        "not available"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "D2",
      "condition": "Does the meeting require special equipment?",
      "branches": [
        "equipment needed",
        "standard room sufficient"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "exceptions": [
    "room unavailable",
    "participant count changes",
    "reservation conflict",
    "equipment unavailable"
  ],
  "dependencies": [
    {
      "from": "A1",
      "to": "A2",
      "type": "control_flow"
    },
    {
      "from": "A2",
      "to": "A3",
      "type": "control_flow"
    },
    {
      "from": "A3",
      "to": "A4",
      "type": "control_flow"
    },
    {
      "from": "A4",
      "to": "A5",
      "type": "control_flow"
    },
    {
      "from": "A5",
      "to": "A6",
      "type": "control_flow"
    }
  ],
  "automation_opportunities": [
    {
      "target": "A2",
      "rationale": "Availability checks can be automated through calendar and reservation APIs."
    },
    {
      "target": "A3",
      "rationale": "Room selection can be rule-based using capacity, location, and equipment constraints."
    },
    {
      "target": "A5",
      "rationale": "Calendar invitation updates can be automated after reservation."
    }
  ]
}
Task: Simulate a concise domain expert who answers only these questions using the reference workflow.
Do not reveal the full reference workflow. Do not add details not needed by the questions.
If a requested fact is absent, explicitly say it is not specified; do not guess.
Use at most 80 words per answer. Return one answer for each question, with matching ID and question text.
Return JSON: {"answers": [{"question_id": "Q1", "question": "original question", "answer": "grounded answer"}]}

